  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Easy File Management with Camunda",
    "splashDescription": "Business processes often require management of different types of files, such as documents, images, and so on. The open source Camunda file storage library (https://github.com/camunda-community-hub/zebee-filestorage) provides a solution to manage files as part of your Camunda-based processes. This Connector uses the library to implement key operations, including uploading, downloading, and deleting files.",
